Description: local Codex bridge and Qt6 persistent terminal views (alpha)
 Local Rust CLI and Qt6 GUI for explicitly registered projects, with
 Konsole KPart and QTermWidget terminal modules. GNU screen is the default
 multiplexer; tmux is optional. Codex must be supplied separately.
 .
 Installation does not start Codex, create or recover sessions, configure
 projects, or install an init service. Debian 13 and Devuan Excalibur use
 the same architecture-specific package.
